member.summary:
            Determines whether the specified  matches an access type for the the specified account with default logic:

 (allow/deny) matches tested ;

 covers requested  (f.e. 'entity' level defined, while tested is 'inheritance' - no good);

 applies to requested  (f.e. 'item:read' defined, while tested is 'item:write' - no good);

Inner  matches  (f.e.  define, while account is not a member of the role - no good);

